# Stage 3 tau2-bench raw simulation dumps (full conversation transcripts,
# can get large across a real sweep) -- keep only the summary.
results/stage3_tau2/*
!results/stage3_tau2/summary.json
# The Stage 5 interpretability evidence: small (278 records), citable,
# and expensive to regenerate (a real paid LLM sweep, not just code) --
# worth keeping alongside summary.json rather than treated as a
# regeneratable dump like the raw per-domain simulation transcripts.
!results/stage3_tau2/efe_decision_log.jsonl
!results/stage3_tau2/interpretability_report.md
# Per-run pipeline artifact (timings churn every run; the citable
# results are the stage-specific JSON files alongside it).
results/pipeline_run.json
